+ *
+ * Tolerance choices:
+ *   - PRICE_EPS = 0.05  → ~5 paise on a NIFTY option (well under bid-ask spread)
+ *   - GREEK_EPS = 1e-3  → 0.1% of typical Greek magnitude
+ *   - IV_EPS    = 5e-3  → ~0.5% absolute IV (Newton solver tolerance)
